WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.900
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:42.200 --> 01:43.830
Hey, Miyako...

01:43.830 --> 01:45.250
What?

01:45.250 --> 01:48.920
We're gymnasts...aren't we?

01:48.920 --> 01:50.420
So?

01:51.130 --> 01:55.090
Why are we doing what the gardening club does?

02:06.100 --> 02:07.440
Geez!

02:07.440 --> 02:08.480
Maron!

02:09.150 --> 02:12.520
Man, I just feel like going home.

02:13.270 --> 02:14.610
No, Maron!

02:14.610 --> 02:16.490
You want to go home too, don't you?

02:16.490 --> 02:17.650
Yeah...

02:17.650 --> 02:20.990
No, it's wrong! They say a bad law is still a law!

02:20.990 --> 02:22.120
You're a liar.

02:22.120 --> 02:22.950
You're just lazy!

02:22.950 --> 02:23.660
What?!

02:29.580 --> 02:31.580
Pakkyamlamao-sensei!

02:31.580 --> 02:37.840
Really, you two. Didn't you understand what I said earlier?

02:37.840 --> 02:41.090
You must perform gymnastics with hearts like flowers.

02:41.090 --> 02:45.310
Only by nurturing flowers can your hearts become like theirs.

02:46.970 --> 02:48.810
But you two...!

02:48.810 --> 02:50.600
I'm sorry.

02:50.600 --> 02:54.070
- Kusakabe, Toudaiji...

02:51.940 --> 02:52.810
- What?

02:52.810 --> 02:54.070
- What did you say?!

02:54.070 --> 02:55.070
Geez!

02:55.070 --> 02:56.610
What do you mean?!

02:56.610 --> 02:58.940
It's your fault!

03:03.320 --> 03:04.700
Really!

03:08.370 --> 03:14.590
The Encircling Net! The Enemy Is the Student Body

03:16.300 --> 03:20.930
If you possess an ugly or wavering heart, you can't perform well.

03:21.680 --> 03:27.520
It's very important to keep the flower in your heart blooming.

03:28.850 --> 03:30.730
Stop it!

03:31.640 --> 03:34.810
Stop it, Pakkyamlamao-sensei!

03:34.810 --> 03:37.530
What's the matter, Vice Principal?

03:37.530 --> 03:44.780
"What's the matter?" you say. Don't you know how valuable this vase is?

03:44.780 --> 03:46.030
Valuable?

03:46.030 --> 03:52.040
This vase was given to the Principal from a noble, when our school was first established.

03:52.040 --> 03:57.000
It is called "The Given Vase" or "Voice of the Noble."

03:57.630 --> 04:00.340
It's inappropriate to put flowers in it.

04:00.840 --> 04:04.840
Flowers exist to bloom. Vases exist to hold flowers--

04:04.840 --> 04:09.390
I'm serious! These flowers don't belong in it!

04:09.390 --> 04:10.560
I don't think--

04:10.560 --> 04:13.690
I think it matches very well.

04:13.690 --> 04:14.440
Chiaki!

04:14.440 --> 04:16.360
Wh-What did you say?

04:16.360 --> 04:19.020
You can tell just in a glance...

04:19.440 --> 04:22.610
Don't you understand its beauty?

04:23.070 --> 04:24.530
Chiaki!

04:29.620 --> 04:34.170
Oh Chiaki, you're the best. You're so cool!

04:34.830 --> 04:38.920
Well, you know I'm an honest guy.

04:38.920 --> 04:39.880
Bah!

04:39.880 --> 04:44.300
When I see a pretty girl, I can't resist saying so. That's all.

04:44.300 --> 04:46.340
Are you talking about me?

04:46.340 --> 04:47.850
Who else?

04:47.850 --> 04:52.140
- Oh, Chiaki...

04:48.550 --> 04:52.140
- Oh, give me a break! What the heck... "An honest guy?!"

04:52.850 --> 04:54.640
Maron, you are, too.

04:54.640 --> 04:55.480
What?

04:56.650 --> 05:02.490
Especially with these gloves and rain boots. Sexier than just in leotards.

05:03.650 --> 05:05.280
Don't you stare at me! Pervert!

05:08.870 --> 05:11.910
Ah! Chiaki, are you okay?

05:16.920 --> 05:18.880
This is it, isn't it?

05:37.810 --> 05:39.810
I can't breathe...

05:41.110 --> 05:43.780
What's...going on?

05:45.740 --> 05:48.280
The meeting will start in 20 minutes.

05:48.280 --> 05:50.870
Before that, submit the daily report...

05:50.870 --> 05:54.870
...and ask Pakkyamlamao-sensei to check the college questionnaire.

05:54.870 --> 05:56.790
And, and...

05:58.580 --> 06:00.460
Pakkyamlamao-sensei!

06:13.760 --> 06:17.180
Fortunately, you guys were nearby.

06:17.180 --> 06:19.600
You saw her fall down, right, Class President?

06:19.600 --> 06:20.900
Y-Yes.

06:23.070 --> 06:26.690
She was fine when we last saw her. Is she anemic?

06:28.700 --> 06:31.950
Her face is...very pale.

06:31.950 --> 06:33.200
She really is...

06:34.030 --> 06:35.870
Maron, you are...

06:37.120 --> 06:42.750
You're worried about Pakkyamlamao-sensei, but you don't care about Chiaki, do you?

06:42.750 --> 06:45.420
But it was his fault.

06:48.300 --> 06:49.590
Sensei!

06:49.590 --> 06:53.220
I'll go call the school doctor.

06:53.220 --> 06:54.600
You don't have to.

06:54.600 --> 06:56.810
But you still look pale...

07:00.850 --> 07:05.860
I can't allow anyone to stand in my way.

07:06.780 --> 07:08.070
Sensei?

07:11.280 --> 07:13.820
Sensei, it's better to lie down for a while.

07:13.820 --> 07:15.160
Be silent.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.620
But...

07:18.120 --> 07:20.120
I can't allow anyone...

07:24.670 --> 07:26.420
...to stand in my way!

07:33.930 --> 07:36.810
Sensei looks weird.

07:36.810 --> 07:38.060
Thanks.

07:41.440 --> 07:43.560
She always looks weird.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.770
I've got to go.

07:44.770 --> 07:46.230
Maron, where are you going?

07:46.610 --> 07:48.190
Fin... Fin!!

07:49.230 --> 07:51.070
Fin, get up!

07:51.950 --> 07:55.070
Hello, Maron. Good night...

07:55.910 --> 07:58.990
Not "Good night!" Get up!

07:58.990 --> 08:03.330
- Get up! Hey! Fin. Fin!

08:01.040 --> 08:03.330
- St-Stop it!

08:10.920 --> 08:11.840
Well?

08:11.840 --> 08:13.180
I feel icky.

08:13.180 --> 08:15.220
I thought so. What should I do?

08:15.220 --> 08:19.810
That's not it. I feel icky because you were shaking me around earlier!

08:19.810 --> 08:22.890
Geez... I'm your beloved partner, remember?

08:34.740 --> 08:37.950
Maron, a Demon is behind all of this.

08:37.950 --> 08:39.330
Are you sure?

08:39.330 --> 08:41.950
I never make mistakes.

08:46.500 --> 08:48.040
Who's there?!

08:52.720 --> 08:58.050
I never imagined that she could become the victim of a Demon. Flower-loving Sensei...

08:58.050 --> 08:59.680
That's exactly why.

09:00.850 --> 09:06.600
The more beautiful a person's heart is, the more a Demon will want to possess it.

09:08.560 --> 09:12.480
If a Demon takes one's heart, what happens to the person?

09:12.480 --> 09:15.950
No one can live without their hearts.

09:15.950 --> 09:16.780
So...

09:18.030 --> 09:18.990
...they die?

09:24.290 --> 09:26.500
I can't allow that to happen.

09:26.500 --> 09:28.210
Fin, prepare a notice card.

09:28.830 --> 09:29.920
What time is it now?

09:29.920 --> 09:33.050
It's uh, well, a bit past 3:30 P.M.

09:33.050 --> 09:37.550
Just you watch! I'll finish the job by 7:00, whatever it takes!

09:37.550 --> 09:40.350
Maron, I'm so happy!

09:40.350 --> 09:43.640
You finally understand what your duty is!

09:43.640 --> 09:45.180
Today is special.

09:45.770 --> 09:49.690
Why? Is it because someone you know is possessed by a Demon?

09:49.690 --> 09:52.360
Whatever. Just hurry up and send the notice card already.

09:53.610 --> 09:55.570
What was that for?

09:55.570 --> 09:59.200
You should be quiet and do what you have to do!

10:01.740 --> 10:05.580
Wow... You're really pretty, Fin.

10:05.580 --> 10:08.370
You're worthy of my love.

10:08.370 --> 10:14.250
However, if I must weigh love and duty, then duty would tip the scale!

10:14.250 --> 10:15.920
Forgive me, Fin.

10:17.880 --> 10:21.850
Yay! Here comes Black Angel, Access Time!

10:23.600 --> 10:29.810
Hmm... "I will bring darkness to your heart! Black Angel, Access Time, is here!"

10:29.810 --> 10:31.690
Is this better?

10:31.690 --> 10:36.490
Let me see... "Black Angel, Access Time, appears!"

10:36.490 --> 10:38.450
Too simple.

10:38.450 --> 10:39.910
Oh well.

10:39.910 --> 10:43.450
I've got to come up with a good idea before meeting with Fin Fish.

10:43.450 --> 10:48.040
Really... To do my duty, I have to forget about love...

10:48.330 --> 10:52.920
No time to waste! I have to report to Sinbad. Let's go, Access! Yeah!!

10:54.000 --> 11:00.430
<i>"I will take the beauty, 'The Given Vase,' before 7:00 P.M." - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

11:00.430 --> 11:03.850
Even worse, the Principal is absent in this situation.

11:03.850 --> 11:07.980
The police? No, no. Calling the police would ruin the honor of the school.

11:07.980 --> 11:09.890
Ahh... What can I do?

11:11.980 --> 11:14.940
What a fool she is, thinking that she can steal my vase.

11:15.900 --> 11:18.150
Whatever it takes, I will catch her.

11:18.150 --> 11:21.490
Of course we have to. But how...?

11:21.490 --> 11:23.490
It's easy.

11:23.910 --> 11:25.990
Hmm? Is that so?

11:27.490 --> 11:30.330
I gotcha. Leave it to me.

11:32.880 --> 11:35.630
To all the students:

11:36.800 --> 11:40.380
Everyone is to report to the gym immediately.

11:41.590 --> 11:47.890
If you don't obey this order, you will be punished without exception!

11:48.640 --> 11:51.850
I repeat: All students are to report to the gym.

11:52.690 --> 11:53.650
Sensei...

11:54.900 --> 11:56.860
It seems like it's started.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.990
Notice

11:59.360 --> 12:01.990
Don't go away!

11:59.360 --> 12:01.990
I'll return right after these messages!

11:59.360 --> 12:01.990
Kaitou Jeanne

12:02.860 --> 12:05.450
Notice

12:02.860 --> 12:05.450
I'm back to continue my adventures

12:02.860 --> 12:05.450
Kaitou Jeanne

12:07.530 --> 12:10.540
This vase is a treasure that belongs to our school.

12:10.540 --> 12:13.580
We must prevent Jeanne from stealing it.

12:13.920 --> 12:18.500
That's right, we won't tolerate that!

12:18.500 --> 12:20.050
Do you all understand?

12:20.050 --> 12:25.640
You must all cooperate to guard the vase and catch Jeanne!

12:28.760 --> 12:29.810
Sensei!

12:30.270 --> 12:32.270
What is it, Toudaiji?

12:32.520 --> 12:37.730
- I think we should ask the police for help in arresting Jeanne. First all of all...

12:35.980 --> 12:37.730
- Be silent!

12:39.270 --> 12:41.690
I have to go to cram school later...

12:42.110 --> 12:43.610
The school's surrounded!

12:43.610 --> 12:45.910
Catch her and use her as an example!

12:46.370 --> 12:48.660
Oh, nobody can leave...

12:51.040 --> 12:54.210
I can't believe what Pakkyamlamao-sensei said!

12:54.710 --> 12:57.630
Catching Jeanne is not a game!

12:57.630 --> 13:01.460
I'll have to catch her by myself.

13:01.460 --> 13:02.460
Are you serious--

13:02.460 --> 13:06.640
Yes, I am. I'll show her what a professional can do!

13:07.180 --> 13:09.640
<i>You're not a professional yet...</i>

13:09.640 --> 13:11.100
- It sounds interesting.

13:11.970 --> 13:14.560
Nagoya-kun, we're facing a serious problem.

13:14.560 --> 13:17.400
Actually, I meant Miyako's plan.

13:17.400 --> 13:22.190
Thanks. You can count on me, I'll definitely catch Jeanne. See ya.

13:22.190 --> 13:24.610
Hey, Miyako!

13:24.610 --> 13:27.780
I'll investigate on my own. Don't follow me.

13:27.780 --> 13:30.410
Oh, typical Miyako...

13:35.290 --> 13:36.370
Sorry.

13:36.370 --> 13:37.250
Why?

13:38.500 --> 13:43.670
Because... You got drenched.

13:43.670 --> 13:45.010
That's why.

13:47.840 --> 13:51.760
They say you can get rid of a cold if you pass it to someone.

13:53.890 --> 13:56.730
Can you help me? Like this...

14:00.230 --> 14:02.520
I said I was sorry. You jerk!

14:04.820 --> 14:09.870
- Nagoya-kun, you shouldn't have done that...

14:08.410 --> 14:09.870
- I was joking.

14:10.660 --> 14:15.410
She looked so apologetic. I just couldn't resist teasing her.

14:27.760 --> 14:30.340
Oh no! It's already 6:00 P.M.

14:30.340 --> 14:31.350
Maron!

14:32.260 --> 14:34.310
Fin, hurry up!

14:35.930 --> 14:36.980
But...

14:48.150 --> 14:49.740
Oh, my...

14:49.740 --> 14:53.030
What can we do? You can't even get close to the vase.

14:54.080 --> 14:58.830
They say: "You can't succeed if you have a weak mind." I'll definitely finish before 7:00!

14:58.830 --> 15:02.380
- But...

14:59.870 --> 15:02.380
- Oh yeah... How about this way?

15:04.800 --> 15:06.130
Okay!

15:13.050 --> 15:14.720
Everything's ready.

15:14.720 --> 15:16.770
Here comes Kaitou Jeanne!

15:20.600 --> 15:23.190
It's Jeanne!

15:26.190 --> 15:28.360
She's appeared! That way! Hurry!

15:42.330 --> 15:44.080
That way! Hurry!

15:47.210 --> 15:47.960
Maron...

15:48.550 --> 15:50.170
...they're gone. Your turn.

15:50.170 --> 15:51.220
Okay.

15:51.800 --> 15:54.390
Hey! It's Jeanne!

15:56.220 --> 15:57.600
There she is!

15:57.600 --> 15:58.600
That way!

15:58.600 --> 16:00.310
Here, here!

16:04.060 --> 16:05.360
She's gone!

16:05.360 --> 16:06.980
A substitution technique?

16:06.980 --> 16:08.360
Well, kinda.

16:10.110 --> 16:11.360
Here she is!

16:14.660 --> 16:15.450
Got her!

16:17.330 --> 16:19.040
No way!!

16:29.840 --> 16:32.590
Hurry up and catch Jeanne!

16:33.260 --> 16:36.220
The club that catches her will have their budget doubled.

16:40.220 --> 16:42.890
Class President, come here!

16:46.020 --> 16:47.400
Okay.

16:48.980 --> 16:51.110
Fin, I'll finish up now.

16:51.110 --> 16:51.940
Okay.

16:52.610 --> 16:54.200
Here I am, Jeanne!

16:55.860 --> 16:56.740
Jeanne!

16:57.280 --> 16:58.580
There she is!

17:02.790 --> 17:04.620
Aim!

17:04.920 --> 17:06.790
Ready, set...

17:15.970 --> 17:17.640
All right!

17:17.640 --> 17:18.720
We got her!

17:26.310 --> 17:28.480
What's this?!

17:32.780 --> 17:35.070
Maron, good luck!

17:35.320 --> 17:36.950
Count on me!

17:38.870 --> 17:41.870
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

17:52.750 --> 17:54.510
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

17:54.510 --> 17:56.380
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

17:56.380 --> 17:57.970
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

18:03.350 --> 18:10.230
Now's the time her notice stated. She's really going to come...

18:10.230 --> 18:12.820
<i>Sorry, it's too late to call the police!</i>

18:15.190 --> 18:20.160
Bonjour! I appear as promised!

18:20.160 --> 18:23.120
Eeeeeeeh! Here comes the thief!

18:23.660 --> 18:29.370
Everybody, catch her!

18:32.340 --> 18:34.340
Rebound Ball, come out.

18:40.050 --> 18:41.350
<i>Game Start!</i>

18:45.680 --> 18:47.180
In the name of God...

18:49.100 --> 18:51.350
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

18:52.110 --> 18:53.730
I seal you here!

18:55.650 --> 18:56.860
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:13.290 --> 19:15.090
The vase was stolen!

19:17.840 --> 19:18.970
<i>Collection completed!</i>

19:27.560 --> 19:28.350
I got her!

19:28.350 --> 19:31.310
It's Miyako Special, Part Three!

19:31.310 --> 19:33.610
I finally caught Jeanne!

19:39.780 --> 19:43.620
No, it can't be! Where is she? Where? Where?

19:48.620 --> 19:49.750
No way...

19:49.750 --> 19:51.330
When did she...?

19:52.960 --> 19:57.090
Damn you!!!

20:00.760 --> 20:03.890
Really now, you almost got caught, Jeanne.

20:10.600 --> 20:13.770
I didn't ask you to save me!

20:13.770 --> 20:14.770
Who are you?!

20:16.060 --> 20:17.650
Kaitou Sinbad.

20:18.730 --> 20:21.570
I came to fight you. To win.

20:22.360 --> 20:24.110
I won't lose.

20:26.950 --> 20:28.240
Remember that.

20:32.210 --> 20:34.540
H-Hey, stop!

20:36.580 --> 20:39.960
Kaitou... Sinbad...

20:41.510 --> 20:43.880
Who the heck is he...?

20:47.300 --> 20:48.220
Sensei...

20:48.220 --> 20:49.970
Pakkyamlamao-sensei?

20:52.180 --> 20:57.860
- The Vase! The Given Vase! I'm going to lose my job over this!

20:53.310 --> 20:57.860
- Why...was I sleeping in such a place?

20:59.270 --> 21:00.780
Toudaiji!!

21:01.440 --> 21:05.410
Did you finish taking care of the flower garden?!

21:05.950 --> 21:06.820
Huh?

21:09.740 --> 21:10.830
Yes, ma'am.

21:12.540 --> 21:18.540
Noooooooo!!! I won't make it!!!

21:21.880 --> 21:24.920
Why are you in such a hurry, Maron?

21:25.720 --> 21:30.180
You collected the Demon, just as your notice said...

21:32.520 --> 21:34.430
This is more important!

21:41.320 --> 21:48.410
<i>However, our challenge will continue... Until the time when we solve the mysteries...</i>

21:49.450 --> 21:51.950
I didn't make it...

21:53.410 --> 21:55.040
Oh, a TV show...

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.390 --> 23:38.220
My grandfather, the head of the Minazuki Group, has done evil things lately...

23:38.220 --> 23:41.480
He doesn't listen to what I say at all.

23:41.480 --> 23:45.940
Don't give up on yourself. You have to convey what you want to say.

23:45.940 --> 23:46.520
But...

23:46.520 --> 23:47.820
Be courageous...

23:47.820 --> 23:51.660
If you have a little more courage, your grandfather will understand.

23:51.660 --> 23:52.910
Maron-san...

23:52.910 --> 23:57.040
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: A Thief can Save a Corporation?!

23:57.490 --> 23:59.580
Just a little courage...
